  m_text: 'THE CANDLE BURNS BEFORE THE FRUIT IS EATEN.


    FIVE KINDS OF CREATURES GATHER WITHIN THE WALLS.


    THE <b>DEER</b> WATCH.

    THE <b>TURTLES</b> WAIT.

    THE <b>SQUIRRELS</b> WANDER.

    THE <b>MICE</b> SCATTER.

