  m_text: 'JUDGEMENT CAME.


    THE TOMATO WON.


    EVERY APPLE WAS REPLACED.


    EVERY RECORD WAS CHANGED.


    EVERY MEMORY WAS ERASED.


    THERE WAS NEVER AN APPLE.


    <b>THERE WAS ONLY THE TOMATO.



    AND THERE ALWAYS WILL BE.</b>



















    THE FRUIT THAT REMAINED by nikosgravos.'
