  m_text: 'THE GARDEN REMEMBERED IT.

    

    THE FALL REMEMBERED IT.

    

    THE TALE REMEMBERED IT.

    

    EVERYWHERE AN APPLE WAS REMEMBERED,

    THE SAME RED SHAPE APPEARED IN ITS PLACE.

    

    YOU HAVE SEEN THE PATTERN.

    

    BUT YOU MISUNDERSTOOD ITS PURPOSE.

    

    IT WAS NEVER TRYING TO REPLACE THE APPLE.

    

    IT WAS TRYING TO ERASE IT.

    

    <b>PIECE TOGETHER ALL YOU REMEMBER.</b>'
