      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'ANOTHER TALE REMEMBERS A POISONED APPLE.

    

    THE APPLE NEVER ARRIVED.

    

    THE SAME RED FRUIT APPEARED IN ITS PLACE.

    

    THE PATTERN IS NO COINCIDENCE.

    

    <b>IT HAS FOLLOWED THE APPLES THROUGH HISTORY, TAKING THEIR PLACE WHEREVER ITS NAME WAS MEANT TO BE REMEMBERED.</b>'
