  m_text: 'THE FIRST RECORD OF ITS PRESENCE LIES BENEATH THE BRANCHES OF PARADISE.


    THE OBJECT HAS BEEN DOCUMENTED THROUGHOUT HUMAN HISTORY.


    IT SHOULD NOT EXIST.


    ITS ORIGIN PREDATES ALL RECORDS.


    ITS PRESENCE IS FOUND WHERE IT SHOULD NOT BE.


    ONLY THE PATTERN REMAINS.


    AN APPLE IS ALWAYS EXPECTED.


    SOMETHING ELSE TAKES ITS PLACE.


    <b>FOLLOW IT UNTIL THE GARDEN FORGETS THE LIGHT.



    BUT YOU SHOULD REMEMBER ALL THAT IS RED.</b>'
